guide forever/professions/lockpicking
title Lockpicking 1-300
category Professions
class Rogue
coords era
levels 16-60
zone Azeroth

# Lockpicking is a Rogue skill: Pick Lock opens locked boxes, chests and doors, and every lock that is
# not too easy for you raises the skill. The skill can never go past five times your level (100 at
# level 20, 150 at 30, 225 at 45, 300 at 60), so the guide asks for those levels as it goes.
#
# Pick Lock comes from your class trainer at level 16 and needs Thieves' Tools in your bags. Boxes
# that mobs drop or that you pickpocket raise the skill too, but the boxes here come back fast.
#

section Lockpicking 1-100

step Reach level 16
  tip Pick Lock needs level 16.
  level 16

step Learn Pick Lock
  tip Any Rogue trainer teaches it; it starts Lockpicking.
  when !knows 1804
  train class

step Buy Thieves' Tools
  tip A tool: Pick Lock does not work without it in your bags.
  buy 5060 x1 nearest

step Pick the Buccaneer's Strongboxes until 80 · the pirate ship near Ratchet
  tip They come back within seconds. The Jewel of the Southsea in the hold spawns a deadly mob.
  only Horde
  goto 65.0,45.4 "the pirate ship near Ratchet" map 1413 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 80

step Pick the Practice Lockboxes until 80 · north of Lake Everstill, Redridge
  tip They come back within seconds.
  only Alliance
  goto 52.0,45.2 "north of Lake Everstill, Redridge" map 1433 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 80

step Reach level 20
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 100 needs level 20.
  level 20

step Pick the Buccaneer's Strongboxes until 100 · the pirate ship near Ratchet
  only Horde
  goto 65.0,45.4 "the pirate ship near Ratchet" map 1413 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 100

step Pick the Practice Lockboxes until 100 · north of Lake Everstill, Redridge
  only Alliance
  goto 52.0,45.2 "north of Lake Everstill, Redridge" map 1433 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 100

section Lockpicking 100-150

step Reach level 30
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 150 needs level 30.
  level 30

step Pick the Waterlogged Footlockers until 150 · Zoram Strand shore, Ashenvale
  tip From 110 the ones in the water work too.
  goto 13.0,23.8 "Zoram Strand shore, Ashenvale" map 1440 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 150

section Lockpicking 150-225

step Reach level 45
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 225 needs level 45.
  level 45

step Pick the Battered Footlockers until 225 · Angor Fortress, Badlands
  tip From 175 the Dented ones count too: a point every time up to 215.
  goto 41.5,28.1 "Angor Fortress, Badlands" map 1418 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 225

section Lockpicking 225-300

step Reach level 60
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 300 needs level 60.
  level 60

step Pick the Dented Footlockers until 300 · The Slag Pit, Searing Gorge or Lost Rigger Cove, Tanaris
  tip Points all the way to 300; past 290 a point comes less often.
  goto 45.3,32.0 "The Slag Pit, Searing Gorge" map 1427 r 30
  goto 73.5,46.6 "Lost Rigger Cove, Tanaris" map 1446 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 300 nearest
